/target
node_modules/
*.local

# Session state, caches, and the single-shot PLAN.md stay local. Matched as
# `.vibectl/*` rather than `.vibectl/` because git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so the negation below could never re-include anything.
.vibectl/*
# Specs are the opposite: requirements, design, and the task list are meant to
# be reviewed in a pull request, so they are committed.
!.vibectl/specs/

# Telemetry / caches from local runs — 1.2MB of LMDB and JSONL that must
# never end up in the repo.
.rust-code/
